    },
    "Most weather apps show you one computer model, wrapped in ads. Weather Consensus checks many forecasts against what really happened here, gives the most accurate ones the biggest say, and tells you how sure it is." : {
      "comment" : "About, Why it exists"
    },
    "Most weather apps show you one computer model. We pull every major one and weigh them by track record into one consensus. %@ has no weather station of its own, so its weights are borrowed and not checked here. Then we tell you how sure we are." : {
      "comment" : "Consensus tab hero text for a place with no station. The value is the place name."
    },
    "Most weather apps show you one computer model. We pull every major one, check each against what really happened in %@, and weigh them by track record into one consensus. Then we tell you how sure we are." : {
      "comment" : "Consensus tab hero text. The value is the place name."
